      {
       "text": "Hey Mechanics!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We’ve just rolled out a hotfix update to address some issues and improve your experience in Rally Mechanic Simulator!",
